      "title": "Discrepancies in dev invoices and duplicate charges in LATAM region",
      "description": "We are seeing issues in our development environment using Payment Gateway v2 in the LATAM region. Several users (about 8) have reported that their invoices are incorrect. Specifically, they are being charged twice for the same subscription. Two of these users have already received chargeback notices from their banks. The impact is currently low as it is limited to dev, but we need this resolved to prevent it from moving to production. Please check the billing logic for this region."
    },
    {
      "i": 18901,
      "title": "Certificate warnings and privilege escalations in SSO Module",
      "description": "We are experiencing certificate warnings in the SSO Integration Module in the EU-West production environment. Additionally, our security team has flagged elevated privileges being observed for approximately 44 users. We think it's because of an improper access review on our side that we missed, causing these permissions to stick around incorrectly. Please investigate if the access lists are outdated or if the module is pulling stale role data."
    },
    {
      "i": 18902,
      "title": "Subscription renewal and invoice issues",
      "description": "Users in US-West are reporting that their subscriptions are not renewing and invoices are wrong. This is affecting a lot of people (over 200). High priority, please fix."
    },
    {
      "i": 18903,
      "title": "Quota exceeded errors in Payment Gateway v2",
      "description": "We are hitting quota exceeded errors and capacity limits in the production Payment Gateway v2 in US-West. About 29 users are affected. The system is rejecting transactions because it seems like the gateway itself has hit its limit. We need to increase the capacity for our account as soon as possible since this is causing payment failures."
    },
    {
      "i": 18904,
      "title": "Critical: Refunds not processing and overcharges in Invoice Service",
      "description": "There is a critical issue with the Invoice Service in US-East production. Refunds initiated via the API are not being reflected in customer accounts, and in some cases, customers are being overcharged instead. This is impacting over 3,000 users. We have verified the transaction IDs and the refunds were accepted by the gateway but never posted to the ledger. Please prioritize this as financial integrity is compromised."
    },
    {
      "i": 18905,
      "title": "MFA rejections and session expirations affecting ANZ users",
      "description": "In the ANZ production environment, users of the Permission Engine are reporting that their MFA codes are being rejected. Additionally, their sessions are expiring unexpectedly shortly after login. This is impacting a high volume of users (482). We are unsure if the Permission Engine is misconfiguring the session timeouts or if the authentication flow itself is failing to validate the codes correctly. Please investigate the interaction between these components."
    },
    {
      "i": 18906,
      "title": "Data residency mismatches and audit log gaps in Analytics Dashboard",
      "description": "We are seeing inconsistencies in the Analytics Dashboard in US-West production. Specifically, data residency flags do not match the expected region settings, and consent records are missing for certain datasets. Furthermore, our compliance team noted gaps in the audit logs during their recent review. This currently affects 3 users internally but poses a compliance risk. Please help us reconcile these data points."
    },
    {
      "i": 18907,
      "title": "Missing localization text and features in Feedback Collector (APAC)",
