    },
    {
      "i": 18908,
      "title": "Retention policy issues in Analytics Dashboard",
      "description": "Retention policies don't seem to be working right in the EU-West Analytics Dashboard. We are seeing old data that should have been purged, and some audit logs are missing. It's a small group of users but it's annoying."
    },
    {
      "i": 18909,
      "title": "MFA and duplicate account issues in Payment Gateway",
      "description": "Some users are getting duplicate accounts created in the US-West Payment Gateway v2 production environment. Also, MFA codes are being rejected for these users. Not sure what's causing it. Need help."
    },
    {
      "i": 18910,
      "title": "Account lockout and missing MFA prompt in EU-West staging",
      "description": "In our EU-West staging environment, we are testing the new user onboarding flow for Payment Gateway v2. One test user has been locked out of their account, and when attempting to log in via the web interface, the MFA prompt does not appear. The account should be active, but the system seems to be stuck in a locked state without triggering the secondary authentication step. This is blocking our QA team from proceeding with the test scenario."
    },
    {
      "i": 18911,
      "title": "API Errors (429/500) and empty responses in Metrics Engine",
      "description": "We are encountering HTTP 429 and HTTP 500 errors when calling the Metrics Engine API in the ME production region. Occasionally, the API returns an empty response instead of data. We are unsure if this is a rate-limiting issue within the Metrics Engine itself or if the underlying Funnel Analysis Engine is failing to return data, causing the gateway to time out or return empty sets. Please investigate which layer is throwing the errors."
    },
    {
      "i": 18912,
      "title": "Consent and retention issues in LATAM Analytics Dashboard (Staging)",
      "description": "In the LATAM staging environment for the Analytics Dashboard, we are seeing that consent records are missing and data residency flags are mismatched. Retention policies are also not being applied correctly. We think this is definitely an incorrect permissions issue where our service account doesn't have the right scope to read the consent database. Please check the IAM roles assigned to the dashboard."
    },
    {
      "i": 18913,
      "title": "Retention policies not applying in ME Analytics Dashboard",
      "description": "Data retention policies are not being applied correctly in the Analytics Dashboard for the ME production region. We have identified that 99 users' data should have been archived or deleted according to our policy, but it remains visible in the dashboard. This is a moderate impact issue related to our data lifecycle management. Please verify if the scheduled cleanup jobs are running for this region."
    },
    {
      "i": 18914,
      "title": "Currency conversion and refund issues in Chargeback Handler (Sandbox)",
